 <h3><u>Shaam haye shaam</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya hussain..(4)<br> Shaam ka bazaar kuja, abid e beemar kuja..(2)<br> zainab e dilgeer kuja, majma e aghyaar kuja<br> haye shaam, haye shaam, haye shaam..(2)</p> 
  <p>Teri ummat ke zewar pehenkar..(2)<br> mere nana chali hu mai shaam<br> shham haye shaam..(3)</p> 
  <p>1. Mai deti kafan tujhko bhayya<br> gar sar pe rida mere hoti<br> gar hote khule haath mere<br> tere zakhmo ko hatho se dhoti<br> pa bande rasan sar barehna..(2)<br> dekho bhayya chali hu mai shaam<br> shham haye shaam</p> 
  <p>2. Jis zainab ko tumne baradar<br> kabhi nazre utha kar na dekha<br> haath rassi se mere bandhe hai<br> aur sar par nahi mere parda<br> kaise kufe mein jaungi ghaazi..(2)<br> jab balwe mein aayega naam<br> shham haye shaam</p> 
  <p>3. Jaise darbaar paas aa raha hai<br> mera dil doobta jaa raha hai<br> mai to ghar mein bhi kam bolti thi<br> bhai tumko to sab kuch pata hai<br> kis tarha se karegi bata de..(2)<br> ek sharabi se zainab kalaam..<br> shham haye shaam</p> 
  <p>4. Dil ye kehta hai ro ro ke bhayya<br> kaash abbas maujood hota<br> kaat deta wo uski zaba'n ko<br> koi baaghi agar mujhko kehta<br> dekhti phir mai kis tarha leta..(2)<br> koi zainab ka majme mein naam<br> shham haye shaam</p> 
  <p>5. Keh rahe hai ye has has ke shaami<br> aane wale hai darbaar baaghi<br> jisne ajdaad maare hamare<br> aa rahi hai yaha uski beti<br> kholta paani pheko chhato se..(2)<br> patharo ka karo intezaam<br> shham haye shaam</p> 
  <p>haye shaam, haye shaam, haye shaam..(2)</p> 
